mods: dev-sandbox
timeout: 90s
hide: true
# Phase-0 3D observer (docs/possible_3d_work.md "Phase 0"): a log-only run. Launch it with MEWFW_OBSERVE3D=3 in the
# environment (`MEWFW_OBSERVE3D=3 npm run test:ingame -- dev-sandbox observe3d`); the framework then hooks
# Camera_render and logs "obs3d ..." lines for world-camera frames 1, 61 and 121 of the fight into
# mod_logs/mewframework.log. Without the variable the hook is not installed and this script is a plain fight smoke.
# The lines of the 2026-10-22 run are pinned in editor/test/fixtures/ingame/observe3d-log.txt (parsed by
# editor/src/core/ingame/obs3d.ts). No shots: nothing is drawn differently.
wait frames 120
seed 42
enter TacticsTest
wait frames 30
cmd spawn Rat
expect console "Spawned Rat" within 10
wait frames 200
quit
